' imported from the 2023-12-31 master release's i/MM.ud-local with C64List 4.04
' (-txt -keycase -varcase -alpha:alt); tools/detok.sh wouldn't write it (it
' doesn't rebuild byte for byte): see the notes below for what changed.

' Image BBS 128 (10/21/2026): jumps to lines in other modules, or to lines
' that don't exist (as in the original), are written {$3d}ddd so that
' C64List leaves the number as it is (it wrote [n] otherwise): 3004, 3010, 3012, 3020, 3022, 3032, 3038, 3044, 3058, 3060, 3064, 3072, 3150, 3174, 3214, 3296
' Image BBS 128 (10/21/2026): C64 addresses in peek/poke/sys are the 128's,
' as {sym:...} names from asm/equates.asm (included below).
{uses:..\3_0-preface.lbl}
{alpha:alt}
{include:"..\asm\equates.asm"}

